  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dutch Precision Week</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project supports a delegation of approximately ten Vietnamese precision engineering companies to participate in the Dutch Precision Week 2026 in the Netherlands. During the mission, companies will attend the Dutch International Precision Conference, the Precision Fair, company visits and a dedicated Southeast Asia networking event organised by the Brabant Development Agency (BOM). The programme enables business matchmaking, knowledge exchange and the exploration of commercial cooperation.The project contributes to stronger Dutch-Vietnamese cooperation in precision engineering and advanced manufacturing while supporting more resilient international supply chains.</narrative>
  </description>
